## 1. Impediment Records

| ID | Date Identified | Description | Affected Task | Impact | Responsible Person | Proposed Solution | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| IMP-001 | To be recorded | To be identified | To be identified | To be assessed | To be assigned | To be agreed | Pending |

## 2. Status Definitions

- **Open:** Issue has been identified but has not yet been addressed.
- **In Progress:** Resolution actions are underway.
- **Blocked:** Resolution cannot proceed without additional assistance.
- **Resolved:** Issue has been addressed and verified.

## 3. Follow-Up and Resolution Notes

Record updates for each impediment, including actions taken, changes in status, and the date it was resolved.

## 4. Scrum Master Responsibilities

- Monitor all recorded impediments.
- Coordinate with responsible team members.
- Help remove obstacles affecting sprint progress.
- Follow up on unresolved issues.
- Update the log until all identified impediments are resolved or appropriately carried forward.

